cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this validation harness in research, please cite it."
title: "spmkit-validation — external black-box validation harness for SPM-Kit"
abstract: "External black-box validation harness that runs SPM-Kit via subprocess, preserving reproducible evidence with frozen tolerances, receipts and canonical hashes. Sa, Sq and Sz cross-validated against Gwyddion 2.71 on synthetic surfaces (LEVEL 3)."
type: software
